Third-party material in this repository

leaderboard/_public_recipe_honghanhhh_024/
  Agent configuration files (agent.yaml, eval_config.yaml, configs/sampling.yaml,
  prompts/system.md) from the public Kaggle notebook "Gemma 4 Baseline | LB 0.24"
  (honghanhhh/gemma-4-baseline-lb-0-24), itself derived from "Gemma 4 | Budget-Aware Coding
  Agent v2" (flexonafft/gemma-4-budget-aware-coding-agent-v2). Extracted byte for byte from the
  config-identical fork kawh1111/g4-baseline-024. Public Kaggle notebooks are released under
  the Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The bundles lb04 and
  later in leaderboard/ are built from these files by leaderboard/build.py; every change made
  to them is recorded there and in leaderboard/README.md.

No competition data (task statements, gold patches, repository snapshots, wheels, code graphs
or embeddings) is included. Scripts that need it download it from Kaggle after the user has
accepted the competition rules.
